# RTL8832BR RFE50 / AP_5G calibration manifest — Tenda RX2L Pro (AX2_PRO_V2)
#
# These files are NOT committed here: vendor RF data (same rule as
# /tmp/rebase/mr1500x-openwrt README section 8). The build extracts them out of
# the stock firmware image it was given and verifies them against this list.
#
# Source of truth for these hashes: our dumped stock rootfs,
#   /tmp/rx_dump/rootfs/x/etc_ro/wlan/rtl8832bre/RFE50/
# Measured 2026-11-07. All files are LF-only (CR count = 0), so no
# $(SED) 's/\r//g' normalisation is needed (unlike the driver .c files).
#
# 12 of these 16 are byte-identical to the copies in
# /tmp/rebase-base package/kernel/rtl8832br-wr1500 (Cudy WR1500 R76).
# The 4 marked BOARD-SPECIFIC are not: RadioA/RadioB are the per-board
# front-end gain tables and both TXPWR_ByRate files carry our own limits.
# If a hash below stops matching, the extraction step is broken -- fail the
# build rather than shipping someone else's power table.

